    "On github.com, open Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Fine-grained tokens → Generate new token. Under Account permissions, set Plan to Read-only; nothing else is needed. AI·mana reads only your Copilot usage report through GitHub's official billing API. The token stays in the iOS Keychain on this iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffne auf github.com Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Fine-grained tokens → Generate new token. Setze unter Account permissions „Plan“ auf Read-only; mehr ist nicht nötig. AI·mana liest nur deinen Copilot-Nutzungsbericht über die offizielle Abrechnungs-API von GitHub. Der Token bleibt im iOS-Schlüsselbund dieses iPhone."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On github.com, open Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Fine-grained tokens → Generate new token. Under Account permissions, set Plan to Read-only; nothing else is needed. AI·mana reads only your Copilot usage report through GitHub's official billing API. The token stays in the iOS Keychain on this iPhone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En github.com, abre Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Fine-grained tokens → Generate new token. En Account permissions, pon Plan en Read-only; no hace falta nada más. AI·mana solo lee tu informe de uso de Copilot a través de la API oficial de facturación de GitHub. El token se queda en el llavero de iOS de este iPhone."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur github.com, ouvrez Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Fine-grained tokens → Generate new token. Dans Account permissions, réglez Plan sur Read-only ; rien d’autre n’est nécessaire. AI·mana lit uniquement votre rapport d’utilisation Copilot via l’API de facturation officielle de GitHub. Le jeton reste dans le trousseau iOS de cet iPhone."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Su github.com apri Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Fine-grained tokens → Generate new token. In Account permissions imposta Plan su Read-only; non serve altro. AI·mana legge solo il tuo report di utilizzo di Copilot tramite l’API di fatturazione ufficiale di GitHub. Il token resta nel portachiavi iOS di questo iPhone."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No github.com, abra Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Fine-grained tokens → Generate new token. Em Account permissions, defina Plan como Read-only; nada mais é necessário. O AI·mana lê apenas o seu relatório de uso do Copilot pela API oficial de cobrança do GitHub. O token fica nas Chaves do iOS deste iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
